ddlers - Holding and Comforting: Both staff members were hyper focused on other job duties, such as hand washing practices, that when multiple children had a minor injury and upset, they did not comfort them or evaluate their level of injury.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026257355","facility_name":"Kimble Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-896108-i20240119-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-896108-i20240119","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-896108","date":"2024-01-19","original_code":"746.2501(4)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-02-13","finding":"Care Requirements for Toddlers - Holding and Comforting: There is sufficient evidence to prove that after a fall occurred in which a toddler fell and hit their head and shoulder on the floor, the caregiver did not hold or comfort the child.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026567257","facility_name":"Kidzville Learning Academy, LLC"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-159058-i20230922-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-159058-i20230922","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-159058","date":"2023-09-22","original_code":"746.2501(4)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-10-04","finding":"Care Requirements for Toddlers - Holding and Comforting: Based on the video footage on 9.19.23 the caregiver was not observed giving individual attention, holding and comforting a child that was crying after being pushed by another child.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026477879","facility_name":"Avance San Antonio Cdc Frank Garrett"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1351298-i20230829-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1351298-i20230829","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1351298","date":"2023-08-29","original_code":"746