e child's crying and told them to \"stop that\".","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026429436","facility_name":"Pro 22:6 Children's Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-219582-i20221209-v9","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-219582-i20221209","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-219582","date":"2022-12-09","original_code":"746.2501(4)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-01-10","finding":"Care Requirements for Toddlers - Holding and Comforting: It was observed a child crying and the caregivers did not comfort the child.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026582692","facility_name":"Compass Christian Preschool"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1317256-i20221205-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1317256-i20221205","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1317256","date":"2022-12-05","original_code":"746.2501(4)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-01-25","finding":"Care Requirements for Toddlers - Holding and Comforting: Based on the information gathered during the investigation, there's sufficient evidence the caregiver did not comfort the upset child.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026688801","facility_name":"Primrose School of Copperfield"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151989-i20220916-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2501-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-151989-i20220916","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-151989","date":"2022-09-16","original_code":"746.2501(4)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-11-02","finding":"Care Requirements for Toddlers - Holding and Comforting: Based on information gathered from an investigation conducted by DFPS, there was evidence sh